                "text": "I recently met with Iowa doctors and patients at MercyOne in Des Moines to talk about how we ensure vulnerable Iowans aren't impacted by D.C. cuts. \n\n160,000 Iowans in our communities rely on Medicaid, and another 60,000 rely on SNAP. My resolution sets commonsense budget rules to ensure that we eliminate waste, fraud, and abuse while protecting Iowa's most vulnerable.",
