                "text": "Our reconciliation package delivers:\n\n\ud83c\udfe5 $50 billion in funding for rural hospitals\n\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Protections for children, pregnant women, seniors, and those with disabilities\n\ud83d\udd0d A crackdown on waste, fraud, and abuse in Medicaid and SNAP\n\nWe're restoring integrity to the system while making sure vulnerable Iowans get the care they need.",
