                "text": "I\u2019m laser-focused on bringing down health care costs for every Iowan. COVID-era tax subsidies and payments to people making over $100K are driving up costs for everyone. Insurance companies are profiting at record highs. My goal is to provide price transparency, help patients, reimburse health care providers, and enable patient choice. My vote delivers for every Iowan, and I\u2019ll continue working to bring down prices for all.",
